["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日帰り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひがえり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">当天往返旅行；一日游</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75279\">これはスキーとバーベキューとパーティーを<ruby>日帰<rp>(</rp><rt>ひがえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りで<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しむいいとこ<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りの<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">滑雪、烧烤、聚会:有了这个计划,你就能得到最好的一切, 并且能在一天的参观中享受这一切。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">東</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひがし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">东；东方</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210091\">その<ruby>市<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はロンドンの<ruby>東<rp>(</rp><rt>ひがし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">伦敦东边是这座城市</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">匹</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">小动物的计数词；布匹的计数词（两反为一匹）；马的计数词（古语）；布匹；布卷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引き上げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひきあげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拉