p>)</rp></ruby>げました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">美联储削减了利率。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引算</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひきざん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">减法；减算</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155301\"><ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>算<rp>(</rp><rt>ざん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きだけど<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>算<rp>(</rp><rt>ざん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>きら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我喜欢加而不是减</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引きずる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひきずる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拖；拖曳；拖着地走；沉重地拖动；强行拉走；硬拖着走；拖长；拖延；影响；说服；引诱；诱使</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引き出し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひきだし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抽屉；提取；取款；应变知识；临机应变的本领</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225748\">きれいなタオルは<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しにありますよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">干净的毛巾在抽屉里</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引き出す</span><span 