-Hans\">他离校这么久了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">久しぶり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひさしぶり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">久违；阔别已久；许久（未见）；好久不见；许久不见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"95545\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>久<rp>(</rp><rt>ひさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しぶりに<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我很久以来第一次接到她的电话</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悲惨</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">悲惨的；不幸的；可悲的；可怜的；惨不忍睹的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141286\"><ruby>戦争<rp>(</rp><rt>せんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>悲惨<rp>(</rp><rt>ひさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>悲<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しみが<ruby>伴<rp>(</rp><rt>ともな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">痛苦和悲伤伴随战争。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">膝</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひざ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">膝盖；大腿上部（坐时）；膝盖及大腿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85500\"><ruby>膝<rp>(</rp><rt>ひざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にナプキンを<ruby>広<rp>(</rp><rt>ひろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げなさい。</span><spa